cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ampliconaudit"
abstract: >-
  Post-hoc detection of silent failures in amplicon taxonomic pipelines:
  steps that exit successfully and write well-formed output while the
  result is quietly degraded or wrong. Combines step contracts, cohort
  invariants and configuration-to-execution provenance.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kurekj/ampliconaudit"
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - amplicon sequencing
  - 16S rRNA
  - quality control
  - silent failure
  - provenance
authors:
  - family-names: Kurek
    given-names: Jaroslaw
    email: jaroslaw_kurek@sggw.edu.pl
    affiliation: "Warsaw University of Life Sciences (SGGW)"
